# Drafty

Same content as tests/rendering/pagination/content/drafty, but this root
builds with --drafts (see build/snapshot.zig's tests/drafts pass), so the
draft becomes active: 4 active posts, page_size=2, 2 full pages, and the
draft appears inside a window. Pins that pagination counts active
subpages, not Section.pages' raw length.
